Package: flippies-apps
Version: 1.3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Create Flippies <flippies@deb.flip>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-tk, apt, sudo
Description: Package center for the Create Flippies desktop
 Flippies Apps lists the programs the network modem's archive at http://deb.flip/
 offers, shows which are installed and their sizes, and installs or removes one
 with a click (apt-get through sudo). Made for 640x480 at 256 colours.
